cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: >-
  qrc_vs_qelm: A pre-registered, resource-matched comparison of Quantum
  Reservoir Computing and Quantum Extreme Learning Machines
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered, resource-matched study comparing Quantum Reservoir
  Computing (a recurrent dissipative Lindblad spin reservoir with intrinsic
  quantum memory) against Quantum Extreme Learning Machines (a static,
  memoryless quantum channel applied to a classical delay-embedding). It
  characterises the memory x nonlinearity phase diagram, the effect of finite
  shot budgets, and the role of engineered dissipation.
